{
  "format": "rsl-strategy@1",
  "name": "intraday_momentum_filtre_quotidien",
  "note": [
    "MOMENTUM DE SEANCE FILTRE PAR LE QUOTIDIEN - « ne jouer la hausse",
    "intraday que si la tendance de fond est haussiere ».",
    "",
    "C'est l'exemple MULTI-HORIZON du depot : deux granularites de la meme",
    "serie dans un seul panneau. Il exige les reglages qui vont avec, et",
    "`examples/reglages/intraday_momentum_filtre_quotidien.json` les porte.",
    "",
    "Aucun essai archive. Forme, pas resultat."
  ],
  "definitions": {
    "grille_horaire": {
      "type": "all_of",
      "operands": [
        {
          "type": "compare",
          "op": ">=",
          "left": {
            "type": "session",
            "field": "minutes_from_open",
            "lag": 0
          },
          "right": {
            "type": "constant",
            "value": 30.0
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "compare",
          "op": "<=",
          "left": {
            "type": "session",
            "field": "minutes_from_open",
            "lag": 0
          },
          "right": {
            "type": "constant",
            "value": 330.0
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "compare",
          "op": "==",
          "left": {
            "type": "arith",
            "op": "%",
            "left": {
              "type": "session",
              "field": "minutes_from_open",
              "lag": 0
            },
            "right": {
              "type": "constant",
              "value": 30.0
            }
          },
          "right": {
            "type": "constant",
            "value": 0.0
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": [
        "Grille horaire : une decision toutes les 30 minutes, de la",
        "minute 30 a la minute 330 depuis l'ouverture DECLAREE.",
        "",
        "`arith %` remplace ici douze comparaisons `any_of`. Attention a la",
        "convention : une barre est horodatee a sa CLOTURE, donc",
        "`minutes_from_open` parcourt 1..N et jamais 0. Le point « 30 minutes",
        "apres l'ouverture » est la barre qui SE FERME a cette minute."
      ]
    },
    "filtre_multi": {
      "type": "peer",
      "symbol": "ES_D",
      "inner": {
        "type": "compare",
        "op": ">",
        "left": {
          "type": "price",
          "field": "close",
          "lag": 0
        },
        "right": {
          "type": "primitive",
          "ref": "sma@1",
          "params": {
            "window": 50
          }
        }
      },
      "note": [
        "Le filtre MULTI-HORIZON : la meme serie, agregee au QUOTIDIEN, lue",
        "depuis le contexte intraday par `peer`.",
        "",
        "Comment cela tient : la seconde entree `data` porte le meme `root` ES",
        "avec un `alias` distinct, et le panneau declare",
        "`allow_mixed_granularity` avec `align_policy: ffill`. La derniere",
        "cloture quotidienne CONNUE est reportee sur les barres intraday - ce",
        "qui est causal, le report n'allant que vers l'avant.",
        "",
        "Mesure du 2026-09-14 : sur ES 15 min + ES quotidien, 100 % des lignes",
        "du panneau portent les deux series."
      ]
    },
    "vwap_ancre": {
      "type": "arith",
      "op": "/",
      "left": {
        "type": "cumulative",
        "stat": "sum",
        "inner": {
          "type": "arith",
          "op": "*",
          "left": {
            "type": "arith",
            "op": "/",
            "left": {
              "type": "arith",
              "op": "+",
              "left": {
                "type": "arith",
                "op": "+",
                "left": {
                  "type": "price",
                  "field": "high",
                  "lag": 0
                },
                "right": {
                  "type": "price",
                  "field": "low",
                  "lag": 0
                }
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "price",
                "field": "close",
                "lag": 0
              }
            },
            "right": {
              "type": "constant",
              "value": 3.0
            }
          },
          "right": {
            "type": "price",
            "field": "volume",
            "lag": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "right": {
        "type": "cumulative",
        "stat": "sum",
        "inner": {
          "type": "price",
          "field": "volume",
          "lag": 0
        }
      },
      "note": "VWAP ANCRE sur la seance declaree, sur le prix typique."
    }
  },
  "strategy": {
    "ref": "panel_rules@1",
    "params": {
      "quantity": 1,
      "allow_pyramiding": false,
      "rules": {
        "entry_long": {
          "type": "all_of",
          "operands": [
            {
              "$ref": "grille_horaire"
            },
            {
              "$ref": "filtre_multi"
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": ">",
              "left": {
                "type": "arith",
                "op": "/",
                "left": {
                  "type": "price",
                  "field": "close",
                  "lag": 0
                },
                "right": {
                  "type": "session",
                  "field": "open",
                  "lag": 0
                }
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "constant",
                "value": 1.002
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": ">",
              "left": {
                "type": "price",
                "field": "close",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "$ref": "vwap_ancre"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "exit_long": {
          "type": "any_of",
          "operands": [
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": "<",
              "left": {
                "type": "price",
                "field": "close",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "$ref": "vwap_ancre"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": "==",
              "left": {
                "type": "session",
                "field": "is_last",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "constant",
                "value": 1.0
              }
            }
          ],
          "note": [
            "Cloture forcee : aucune position ne franchit la nuit. C'est ce qui",
            "fait d'une strategie une strategie INTRADAY, et non un swing trade",
            "qui se trouve decider souvent."
          ]
        },
        "entry_short": {
          "type": "all_of",
          "operands": [
            {
              "$ref": "grille_horaire"
            },
            {
              "type": "not",
              "inner": {
                "$ref": "filtre_multi"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": "<",
              "left": {
                "type": "arith",
                "op": "/",
                "left": {
                  "type": "price",
                  "field": "close",
                  "lag": 0
                },
                "right": {
                  "type": "session",
                  "field": "open",
                  "lag": 0
                }
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "constant",
                "value": 0.998
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": "<",
              "left": {
                "type": "price",
                "field": "close",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "$ref": "vwap_ancre"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "exit_short": {
          "type": "any_of",
          "operands": [
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": ">",
              "left": {
                "type": "price",
                "field": "close",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "$ref": "vwap_ancre"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "op": "==",
              "left": {
                "type": "session",
                "field": "is_last",
                "lag": 0
              },
              "right": {
                "type": "constant",
                "value": 1.0
              }
            }
          ],
          "note": [
            "Cloture forcee : aucune position ne franchit la nuit. C'est ce qui",
            "fait d'une strategie une strategie INTRADAY, et non un swing trade",
            "qui se trouve decider souvent."
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
